  ('Replacement Shaft for 2000 Series Dual Mode Servo Gear Set - 6 Pack', '2918-2000-0002', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-shaft-for-2000-series-dual-mode-servo-gear-set-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1829/images/9850/2918-2000-0002-shaft-6-Pack__17888__78081.1701993921.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Replacement Servo Case for goBILDA® Servo (V3.0)', '2918-2000-0301', 'Servos aren''t invincible! A replacement case can provide a face-lift and restore your servo''s shape for proper fitment. It''s a great backup part to have in your toolbox for when your servos return from the ring with a missing mounting ear. This Replacement Case is specific to 2000 Series and 2002 Series goBILDA® Servos that have "V3.0" molded into the top. Before purchasing this Replacement Case, check the top of the case of the servo you''re repairing. If your servo has "V3.0" molded into the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-servo-case-for-gobilda-servo-v3-0/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2188/images/12529/2918-2000-0301-Together-2__39808__18837.1719245646.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('12mm Tall Rubber Foot (1-1) - 8 Pack', '2919-0001-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12mm-tall-rubber-foot-1-1-8-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1587/images/8331/2919-0001-0001__94106__99103.1701993428.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Rubber Feet', 'gobilda'),
  ('2920 Series Steel Set-Screw Collar (6mm Bore) - 2 Pack', '2920-0001-0006', 'Set-screw collars are the smallest of all the collars. They create less rotating mass and are well balanced so they don''t create vibration in high-speed applications. Set-screw collars are best used with D-shaft so the set-screw doesn''t marr an edge that might come in contact with a bearing.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2920-series-steel-set-screw-collar-6mm-bore-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1600/images/8395/2920-0001-0006__70511__13420.1701993450.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2920 Series Steel Set-Screw Collar (8mm Bore) - 2 Pack', '2920-0001-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2920-series-steel-set-screw-collar-8mm-bore-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1934/images/10450/2920-0001-0008__17254__43793.1701994110.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2920 Series Steel Set-Screw Collar (12mm Bore) - 2 Pack', '2920-0001-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2920-series-steel-set-screw-collar-12mm-bore-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1676/images/8743/2920-0001-0012__86257__34145.1701993567.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2920 Series Steel Set-Screw Collar (8mm REX® Bore) - 2 Pack', '2920-0001-4008', 'SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING NYLON PATCH The set-screw included with this product features a nylon patch: a blue dollop of thread-locking magic that ensures extraordinary resistance to loosening from vibration!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2920-series-steel-set-screw-collar-8mm-rex-bore-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1557/images/8149/2920-0001-4008__54062__69557.1701993374.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('Loctite Threadlocker (Blue 242, 6mL)', '2922-0001-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/loctite-threadlocker-blue-242-6ml/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1548/images/8089/2922-0001-0001__20524__72494.1701993356.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Thread Locker', 'gobilda'),
  ('Super Lube Synthetic Grease With PTFE (Clear, 1mL) - 2 Pack', '2922-0002-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/super-lube-synthetic-grease-with-ptfe-clear-1ml-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1576/images/8262/2922-0002-0001__45736__98005.1701993409.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Lubricants', 'gobilda'),
  ('Polycarbonate Clamping Collar (8mm REX® Bore) - 4 Pack', '2923-1024-4008', 'Lightweight and balanced, this 8mm REX® Bore Polycarbonate Clamping Collar provides a low-cost, non-marring solution for component constraint on 8mm REX® shafts and standoffs. The built-in shim allows you to run it directly against a bearing without binding the inner race, and the hex capture nuts allow you to install it with only one(1) tool. Thanks to a two-piece construction that allows this collar to come apart, you can go all the way into the depths of your robot and adjust the shaft-collar…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/polycarbonate-clamping-collar-8mm-rex-bore-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2094/images/11459/Ang2__60019__07645.1711057539.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('Cable-Carrier Chain (10mm x 15mm, 1 meter Length)', '2924-1015-1000', 'Guide your wires out of the mess and into safety with Cable-Carrier Chain! A chafed wire can bring down the best of builds. The protected wire chase of Cable-Carrier Chain prevents chafing and ensures predictable movement that''s limited to one(2) back-and-forth path of motion. The chain opens easily to allow access to wires, and it closes securely to keep those wires right where you put them. The ends can fasten to your goBILDA® project via the included plates.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/cable-carrier-chain-10mm-x-15mm-1-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2238/images/13331/2924-1015-1000-Cable-Carrier-Chain__68210__30851.1726003756.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('Braided Cable Sleeve (8mm Diameter, 3 meter Length)', '2925-0008-3000', 'This 8mm Diameter, 3 meter Length Braided Cable Sleeve can wrap around groups of wires in your project to organize and protect your wiring setup while also preventing tangles. The sleeve''s material memory is such that you can open it down its length, place wires inside, and then simply allow the sleeve to close around your wires. Even with its solid hold around your wires, this sleeve is still flexible enough to navigate elaborate paths in your project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/braided-cable-sleeve-8mm-diameter-3-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2203/images/12609/Closeup__27011__82954.1720446508.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('PTFE Cable-Guide Tubing (2mm ID, 4mm OD, 1 meter Length)', '2926-0204-1000', 'This Cable-Guide Tubing allows you to guide cable along unorthodox paths as well as safely through 4mm holes. Both of those capabilities result from the tubing''s low-friction polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) construction, which keeps cables safe from fraying against other components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/ptfe-cable-guide-tubing-2mm-id-4mm-od-1-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2016/images/11057/2926-0204-1000-2__96724__04363.1701994301.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / PTFE Tubing', 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm Pattern Debris-Shield (Ø14mm Barb for 6mm Thick Material) - 6 Pack', '2927-0014-0001', 'Keep dust and debris out of your project with this Debris-Shield! This plastic component is designed to mount to 6mm thick material (such as the plastic plates of the Overlander-4) according to a goBILDA® 32mm square and 14mm center hole pattern. When mounted as such, the center protrusion of this Debris-Shield locks into place the same way as a barbed grommet. The tight fitment helps to keep the environment out of your project when you''re operating it amongst sand, silt, gravel, or other…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-pattern-debris-shield-o14mm-barb-for-6mm-thick-material-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2297/images/13674/2929-0014-0001_Ang1__61109__98578.1730384549.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Debris-Shields', 'gobilda'),
  ('Silicone Rubber Cord (8mm Diameter, 50A Durometer, 2 meter Length)', '2928-0008-0002', 'When your intake needs to keep its shape under pressure, this solid Silicone Rubber Cord is the way to go. It offers excellent durability and long-term performance, maintaining its flexibility and grip throughout the season. With a solid 8mm profile and a 50A durometer, this cord provides the high-friction surface you need, along with greater structural integrity than hollow tubing. It''s a great choice for FTC robots where a firmer contact surface helps maintain consistent, repeatable intake…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/silicone-rubber-cord-8mm-diameter-50a-durometer-2-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2507/images/16655/2928-0008-0002__50002__47655.1776887798.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Silicone Rubber Tubing (5mm ID x 8mm OD, 50A Durometer, 2 meter Length)', '2928-0508-0002', 'Ready to give your intake a better grip? While many FTC teams rely on latex surgical tubing, our Silicone Rubber Tubing offers an alternative with excellent durability and long-term performance. Silicone maintains its flexibility and grip over time, making it a reliable choice season after season. With a 50A durometer and a hollow profile, this tubing provides the ideal amount of compliance to conform to game elements for a consistent, dependable intake. It''s a great choice for FTC robots…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/silicone-rubber-tubing-5mm-id-x-8mm-od-50a-durometer-2-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2505/images/16495/Ang1__94466__49369.1776456311.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Rubber Tubing & Cord', 'gobilda'),
  ('NiMH Battery (6V, 2700mAh, 2-Pos TJC8 Power Connector [MH-FC], 6-1)', '3100-0006-0001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/nimh-battery-6v-2700mah-2-pos-tjc8-power-connector-mh-fc-6-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1034/images/5019/3100-0006-0001__50971__81802.1701992402.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / 6V Batteries', 'gobilda'),
  ('NiMH Battery (6V, 3000mAh, XT30 Connector [MH-FC], 20A Fuse, 6-3)', '3100-0006-0003', 'This 6V battery contains five 3000mAh sub-C cells wired in series. The high strand silicone wire has a built-in mini-blade fuse holder with a 20A fuse pre-installed. The XT30 connector provides a secure connection in a small form factor. The width of the battery is just shy of 43mm so that it''s able to slide down inside 1120 Series U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/nimh-battery-6v-3000mah-xt30-connector-mh-fc-20a-fuse-6-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1163/images/5818/3100-0006-0003__25708__75076.1701992657.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / 6V Batteries', 'gobilda'),
  ('12V NiMH Nested Battery (3000mAh, MH-FC XT30 Connector)', '3100-0012-0020', 'The nested form-factor of this 12V battery allows it to be tucked away in an 1120 Series U-Channel to protect it from the moving pieces of your chassis. The XT30 connector is an easy-to-use, indexed style connector that provides a reliable and dummy-proof connection to the electronics of your robot.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12v-nimh-nested-battery-3000mah-mh-fc-xt30-connector/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/533/images/13166/3100-0012-0020-goBILDA-Battery-FTC-Legal__01770.1722883473.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / 12V Batteries', 'gobilda'),
  ('20V, 6Ah Li-ion Battery with LED Capacity Meter', '3100-1020-0001', 'Power your project with a battery rocking the familiar DEWALT® 20V form factor! This mighty Li-ion battery has a capacity of 6.0Ah to deliver 20V to your heavy-duty project. A series of LEDs indicate remaining power, and it''s designed with protections against reverse-polarity, overloading, short-circuiting, and overheating. Pair it with the goBILDA® Smart Dock to power your project for heavy-duty 20V action! Of course, to keep your battery charged, you''ll also want the aid of the 20V Li-ion…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/20v-6ah-li-ion-battery-with-led-capacity-meter/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1918/images/10390/3100-1020-0001__15115__33842.1701994090.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / 20V Batteries', 'gobilda'),
  ('6V Battery Charger (NiCad/NiMH, XT30 Connector)', '3101-0006-0001', 'This smart charger is designed charge our 6VDC batteries. It has a charge current of 1.0A which will drop to 0.07A once the battery reaches capacity in order to maintain the peak voltage while protecting the cells from being overcharged.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6v-battery-charger-nicad-nimh-xt30-connector/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1229/images/6119/3101-0006-0001__90444__76275.1701992754.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Chargers', 'gobilda'),
  ('12V Battery Charger (NiCad/NiMH, XT30 Connector)', '3101-0012-0001', 'This smart charger is designed to charge our 12VDC NiMH batteries. It has a charge current of 1.0A, which will drop to 0.07A once the battery reaches capacity in order to maintain the peak voltage while protecting the cells from being overcharged. Usage Guidelines: • After plugging the charger into an outlet, the LED on the front of the charger will turn green, indicating it is ready to charge. • Once the battery is connected, the LED will turn red until the battery is fully charged. • The LED…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/battery-charger-nicad-nimh-12-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/535/images/3402/3101-0012-0001__51392__74927.1701991886.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Chargers', 'gobilda'),
  ('20V Li-ion Battery Charger (DEWALT® 20V MAX Compatible)', '3101-1020-0001', 'This 20V Li-ion Battery Charger allows you to charge any battery that has the familiar DEWALT® 20V MAX form factor. It''s a perfect fit for the 20V, 6Ah Li-ion Battery ! Its LED indicator displays your battery''s status between charging and charged, and will also let you know if the battery is too hot or too cold to be charged safely. This charger is equipped with protections against overheating and short-circuiting. It can also detect—and protect itself against—damaged batteries. ⚠️Li-ion…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/20v-li-ion-battery-charger-dewalt-20v-compatible/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1916/images/13691/3101-1020-0001-DeWalt-Brand-12v-20v__55904.1730410928.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Chargers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Programmer for 2000 Series Dual Mode Servo', '3102-0001-0001', 'The Dual Mode Servo Programmer allows you to unlock the full potential of the 2000 Series Dual Mode Servo. With this programmer you can easily switch the servo between the default mode and continuous rotation mode. In the default mode the servo is able to rotate a maximum of 280 degrees and has positioning feedback. This mode is excellent for applications requiring precise and repeatable moves. In continuous rotation mode the servo will operate like a gear motor coupled to a speed controller.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-programmer-for-2000-series-dual-mode-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/801/images/4499/3102-0001-0001__95194__11687.1701992214.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Axon Servo Programmer MK2', '3102-0002-0001', 'The Axon Servo Programmer MK2 pulls double duty as both a comprehensive software programming interface and a standalone hardware servo tester. Whether you are dialing in exact endpoint limits at your desktop or testing an intake mechanism right on your robot, this tool unlocks the true potential of an Axon servo. Compatibility The Axon Servo Programmer MK2 is fully compatible with the Axon MINI Servo MK2 and Axon MAX Servo MK2. Getting Started Ready to program your servos? Follow these simple…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/axon-servo-programmer-mk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2546/images/16919/s%25252F702%25252FAng1__00924__87954.1783710998.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch (Roller Lever) - 2 Pack', '3103-0001-0001', 'These awesome little 5 amp units are perfect to use in conjunction with our goBILDA® components. Besides this style, we offer three other limit switches to cover just about any need you have, whether you''re building a slider, a 3D printer or a killer robot. Make sure you check out our limit switch mounts, too!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/micro-limit-switch-roller-lever-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/992/images/4958/3103-0001-0001__43537__19984.1701992374.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Limit Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch (Bump Lever) - 2 Pack', '3103-0001-0002', 'This switch has a bump, sometimes referred to as an imitation roller, on the end of the lever. The bump creates a consistent point of contact for accurate switch actuation.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/micro-limit-switch-bump-lever-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1048/images/5126/3103-0001-0002__79300__05948.1701992438.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Limit Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch (Straight Lever) - 2 Pack', '3103-0001-0003', 'These awesome little 5 amp units are perfect to use in conjunction with our goBILDA® components. Besides this style, we offer three other limit switches to cover just about any need you have, whether you''re building a slider, a 3D printer or a killer robot. Make sure you check out our limit switch mounts, too!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/spdt-miniature-limit-switch-with-lever-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2402/images/15032/605630_snap_action_micro_switches_lever_1500px__19429.1568244333.1280.1280__91489__00728.1751405081.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Limit Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Micro Limit Switch (No Lever) - 2 Pack', '3103-0001-0004', 'These awesome little 5 amp units are perfect to use in conjunction with our goBILDA® components. Besides this style, we offer three other limit switches to cover just about any need you have, whether you''re building a slider, a 3D printer or a killer robot. Make sure you check out our limit switch mounts, too!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/spdt-miniature-limit-switch-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2401/images/15035/605628_snap_action_micro_switches_1400px_2__44308.1568244334.1280.1280__36602__29484.1751405082.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Limit Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Auxiliary Switch for goBILDA® Smart Dock (with Mounting Plate)', '3103-0004-0001', 'This remote switch is useful when your battery is nestled down inside your project. The switch simply plugs into the side of the goBILDA® Smart Dock via the auxiliary "SWITCH" connector and allows you to turn the Dock''s power on and off from afar. A mounting plate with holes on the goBILDA® 8mm linear pattern is included to help you implement this switch directly into the structure of your project! If you''re using the switch without the included mounting plate, the spring-tabs of the panel…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/auxiliary-switch-for-gobilda-smart-dock-with-mounting-panel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2300/images/13721/3103-0004-0001__53923__42479.1731614204.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Rocker Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Floodgate Power Switch (XT30, Current Sensing)', '3103-0005-0001', 'Open the floodgates to more performance, data, and ease-of-use in your projects with the XT30 Current-Sensing Floodgate Power Switch! It''s a robust MOSFET-based rocker switch designed from the heft of FIRST Tech Challenge (FTC) experience in the goBILDA® R&D lab. This page provides information for the V2 of the Floodgate Power Switch. For information on the recalled V1, you can visit its product page. A Rocker Switch with (Almost) No Resistance The power switches that are most commonly used in…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/floodgate-power-switch-xt30-current-sensing/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2414/images/15679/Ang1__95539__26666.1766090203.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / Rocker Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Floodgate Power Switch (XT30, Current Sensing) [V1]', '3103-0005-0001-v1', '⚠️PRODUCT RECALL: This product has a known issue that can, in rare cases, cause problems on certain robot designs, presenting as robot "disconnects". We''re taking several steps to ensure your team has a successful season and to turn this potential frustration into a better experience: Account Credit: If you have purchased a Floodgate Power Switch from us, we''ve applied a $35 credit to your account to cover the cost. We don''t believe you should be charged for something that doesn''t perform as…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/floodgate-power-switch-xt30-current-sensing-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2469/images/16562/3103-0005-0001-Ang1__90101.1776459859.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Battery Tray (4 Cell, Square Pack, 2-Pos TJC8 Power Connector [MH-FC])', '3104-0006-0001', 'This 4 cell AA battery tray is great for powering low current consumption items that require 6V. The 2 position TJC8 connector is compatible with 2.54mm (0.100") row pins found on breadboards, R/C receivers, servo controllers and servo programmers.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/battery-tray-4-cell-square-pack-2-pos-tjc8-power-connector-mh-fc/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1074/images/5281/3104-0006-0001-Ang-2__37391__01152.1701992485.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Mounts & Trays', 'gobilda'),
  ('goBILDA® Smart Dock for 20V Battery (DEWALT® 20V MAX Compatible)', '3104-0020-0001', 'This goBILDA® Smart Dock is a perfect way to power your project with a mighty 20V Li-ion battery! Just dock your favorite 20V battery that has the DEWALT® 20V MAX form factor, and put your project in motion. (The 20V, 6Ah Li-ion Battery with LCD Capacity Meter is a perfect fit!) Your 20V battery brings the brawn. The Smart Dock lives up to its name with its safety-ensuring brains! Its smart protection features mean your battery won''t be damaged by the demands of the device it powers. Multiple…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-smart-dock-for-20v-battery-dewalt-20v-max-compatible/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1920/images/10411/3104-0020_0001_Ang1__32005__02250.1701994096.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Mounts & Trays', 'gobilda'),
  ('1x15A Motor Controller (9-14V Input)', '3105-0101-0015', 'This motor speed controller is a compact, easy way to control the speed and direction of a brushed DC motor! Just plug in your motor, a battery (between 9V and 14V), and a receiver to get your motor moving. Wiring: Receiver: If you are using an R/C receiver, simply plug this 3-wire connector into the desired channel. The built-in 6V BEC (which can supply 3A continually) will power your receiver via the red wire. It can also be plugged into a servo controller or an Arduino (via jumper wires) or…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1x15a-motor-controller-9-14v-input/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1596/images/14776/3105-0101-0015__00234.1746129882.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1x20A Motor Controller (9-30V Input)', '3105-0101-0020', 'This motor speed controller is a compact, easy way to control the speed and direction of a brushed DC motor! Just plug in your motor, a battery (between 9V and 30V), and a receiver to get your motor moving. Wiring Receiver If you are using an R/C receiver, simply plug this 3-wire connector into the desired channel. The built-in 6V BEC (which can supply 6A continually) will power your receiver via the red wire. It can also be plugged into a servo controller or an Arduino (via jumper wires) or…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1x20a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2385/images/14774/Ang1__24267__99138.1746127295.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1x30A Motor Commander', '3105-0101-1030', 'Sometimes you just want to dial in the speed! The 1x30A Motor Commander takes complexity out of the equation, leaving you with a simple knob that controls the speed and direction of your brushed DC motor. Precision dial control is a huge benefit to all kinds of projects—whether you''re doing a timelapse with a pan or slider assembly, or you''re welding or airbrushing a cylindrical item that needs to be rotated at just the right speed. Bidirectional function means that you can achieve motor…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1x30a-motor-commander/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2356/images/14370/3105-0101-1030-Matches-Angle-of-other-Motor-Controllers__68219__92455.1737739042.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('2x40A Motor Controller', '3105-0201-0040', 'The 2x40A Motor Controller is the peanut butter if the goBILDA® 20V Smart Dock is the jelly! This 2-channel controller is ready to proportionally control the speed and direction of up to two Saturn Planetary Gear Motors per channel. Add the 20V Battery and goBILDA® 20V Smart Dock to that mix to unleash heavy-duty 20V action! Each of the two channels can handle 40A continuously, and up to 50A peak. Motor control is facilitated safely thanks to temperature, current, and reverse-voltage…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2x40a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1913/images/10370/Ang1__58459__04905.1745872754.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual 5A PWM Switch', '3108-0102-0201', 'The PWM Controlled Switch is a plug-n-play solution for turning DC circuits on and off from afar! Use a wireless transmitter and receiver, or your servo controller of choice, to direct the circuits with a PWM signal. The signal sent to the switch via the TJC8 servo connector determines the channels'' on/off state among three options: both off at less than 1400 microseconds, one(3) off/one(4) on at 1400-1600 microseconds, or both on at greater than 1600 microseconds. Each output is able to handle an impressive 5A…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-5a-pwm-switch/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1750/images/9252/3108-0102-0201__19061__98876.1701993727.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Switches / PWM Switches', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Power Distribution Board (8 Channel)', '3108-2827-0801', 'Rocking a full 8 channels to deliver power to your servos, the Servo Power Distribution Board (Servo PDB) distributes power between electronics generating PWM signals and the components receiving them! Distribution and Isolation All positive contacts of the Servo PDB are tied together as well as its negative contacts, optimizing it to power logic devices and servos with the same battery. You can also isolate electrical connections by removing or excluding positive wires from connections…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-power-distribution-board-8-channel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1350/images/15025/3108-2827-0801--REV2t__48844.1751403070.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Power Distribution Board (XT30 Input, 8 x XT30 Outputs) [V1]', '3108-2833-0801', 'The Power Distribution Board (PDB) delivers power throughout your build! Just plug a power source into the PDB''s XT30 input. It''ll distribute that source''s voltage across eight face output connectors, as well as a side connector that''s conveniently located to daisy-chain with electrical components. And thanks to thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, this PDB is extensively mountable to almost anything in the goBILDA® system!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-power-distribution-board-xt30-input-8-x-xt30-outputs-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1766/images/9341/3108-2833-0801_ftc-legal__86644__62843.1701993753.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Power Distribution Board (XT30 Input, 8 x XT30 Outputs)', '3108-2833-0802', 'The Power Distribution Board delivers power throughout your build. Simply plug your power source into one(5) of its XT30 connectors to power them all! The voltage is distributed across all of the remaining connectors, including side connectors that are conveniently located to daisy-chain with electrical components. And thanks to thru-holes (with nifty hex counterbores) on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, it''s super mountable to almost anything in the goBILDA® system!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-power-distribution-board-xt30-input-8-x-xt30-outputs/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2376/images/14630/Ang1__49694__98336.1743001139.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Power Distribution Boards', 'gobilda'),
  ('XT30 Power Distribution Board (XT90 Input, 8 x XT30 Outputs)', '3108-4933-0801', 'This Power Distribution Board (PDB) delivers power throughout your build! Just plug a power source into its XT90 input. It''ll distribute that source''s voltage across nine XT30 outputs, including one(6) conveniently positioned on the side to daisy-chain with other on-pattern electrical components. And thanks to thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, this PDB is extensively mountable to almost anything in the goBILDA® system!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/xt30-power-distribution-board-xt90-input-8-x-xt30-outputs/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1914/images/10379/3108-4933-0801__46605__69892.1701994086.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Power Distribution Boards', 'gobilda'),
  ('Mecanum Mixer [V1]', '3109-0001-0001', 'The Mecanum Mixer is a crazy-simple, no-coding solution for the control of a mecanum chassis (like the Strafer® !). Just plug it into your receiver and motor controllers, then let its signal mixing handle the rest. Your chassis will be skid-steering and strafing—both horizontally and diagonally—in no time at all! Mounting Thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern make the Mecanum Mixer compact and mountable alongside other goBILDA® electronics. Wiring Three TJC8 Servo Male-to-Male Servo…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/mecanum-mixer-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1762/images/9327/3109-0001-0001__50637__74317.1701993749.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Mecanum Mixer', '3109-0001-0002', 'The Mecanum Mixer is a crazy-simple, no-coding solution for the control of a mecanum chassis (like the Strafer® !). Just plug it into your receiver and motor controllers, then let its signal mixing handle the rest. Your chassis will be skid-steering and strafing—both horizontally and diagonally—in no time at all! Mounting Thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern make the Mecanum Mixer compact and mountable alongside other goBILDA® electronics, and hex counterbores (that can hold hex…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/mecanum-mixer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2403/images/15123/Ang1__98410.1755704241.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Signal Mixers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Travel Tuner', '3109-0002-0001', 'Control How Far Your Servo Travels! Just plug it inline between your servo and your receiver then adjust the dials! You can achieve more or less rotation than you would otherwise get. Plug-n-Play No coding or servo programming required. Just set it to your liking and leave it in inline with your servo. The small footprint is able to tuck away inside your R/C vehicle or robot chassis and you''re ready to go. Why is it needed? The amount that a servo can rotate is based on the signal it receives…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-travel-tuner/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1493/images/7633/3109-0002-0001_REV1__91346__68991.1701993225.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Dual Servo Commander', '3109-0003-0001', 'The Dual Servo Commander allows you to rule the rotation of your servos. Each knob provides real-time servo control while six buttons store configurable travel positions. You can also use the buttons to select your preferred PWM range among four preset options during power-up! Servo Connection Two pairs of 2.54mm (0.1") headers allow you to put up to four servos under the Dual Servo Commander''s control. Each knob can control up to two of those servos on a single channel. If you need extra…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/dual-servo-commander/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2165/images/11829/Ang5__69359__97377.1714768595.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Commander [V1]', '3109-0004-0001', 'Rule the rotation of your servo with the Servo Commander! Its input knob provides real-time servo control while four buttons store configurable travel positions. You can even use the buttons to select your preferred PWM range among four preset options during power-up! Servo Connection Two sets of 2.54mm (0.1") headers allow you to put up to two servos under the Servo Commander''s control. Voltage Input The Commander can be powered by a DC input voltage between 5 and 15V. The XT30 connector is…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-commander-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1767/images/9353/3109-0004-0001_Rev1__14985__36239.1701993757.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Commander', '3109-0004-0002', 'Rule the rotation of your servo with the Servo Commander! Its input knob provides real-time servo control while four buttons store configurable travel positions. You can even use the buttons to select your preferred PWM range among four preset options during power-up! Servo Connection Two sets of 2.54mm (0.1") headers allow you to put up to two servos under the Servo Commander''s control. Voltage Input The Commander can be powered by a DC input voltage between 5 and 15V. The XT30 connector is…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-commander/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2377/images/14676/Ang1__83894.1743772173.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Monitor [V1]', '3109-0005-0001', 'The Servo Monitor is a tool that allows you to easily check servo vitals. Just plug a servo controller into one(7) side and a servo into the other. The screen will display the value for the selected mode in real time! Press the pushbutton to cycle through the five modes. Modes: Voltage This mode displays the voltage being sent to the servo. The wire is used to supply power to the motor within the servo. Sending the correct voltage to a servo is important, and this mode keeps you in-the-know about…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-monitor-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1936/images/10467/3109-0501-0001__76356__13795.1701994115.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Monitor', '3109-0005-0002', 'The Servo Monitor is a tool that allows you to easily check servo vitals. Just plug a servo controller into one(8) side and a servo into the other. The screen will display the value for the selected mode in real time! Press the pushbutton to cycle through the five modes. Modes: Voltage This mode displays the voltage being sent to the servo. Sending the correct voltage to a servo is important, and this mode keeps you in-the-know about any excessive voltage, as well as the battery''s charge level.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-monitor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2387/images/14871/Ang1__87342__61179.1748024278.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('4 Channel Servo Recorder', '3109-0006-0001', 'Record and play back multiple servos'' movements with the 4 Channel Servo Recorder! It allows you to control up to four servos with a customizable recording up to 26 minutes in duration. Beyond simply recording and playing back servo movement, the Servo Recorder can fine-tune the playback to your project by allowing you to choose when and how servos return to their original positions. Each of the four channels can be modified to a user-defined range of motion, as well as altered for reversed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-channel-servo-recorder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1938/images/10477/3109-0006-0001-4-Channel-Servo-Recorder__74543__08775.1701994118.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Travel Reverser', '3109-0007-0001', 'Reverse your servo''s rotation with the Servo Travel Reverser! This 300mm length TJC8 extension plugs inline with your servo wiring to modify PWM signal so that your servo rotates opposite the direction communicated by the PWM signal while still traveling the same distance.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-travel-reverser/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2025/images/11090/3109-0007-0001__77886__13877.1701994313.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Joystick (2 Channel)', '3109-0008-0001', 'Whether you''re operating a video game or a robot, it''s a joy to use a joystick! You know right away how your thumb can command mechanical movement. Simple, compact, and ergonomic, the Servo Joystick enhances that easy-peasy joystick control with a suite of configurable control options. Just plug in your servos and use the switches to choose exactly the PWM range and position control style you want. Servo Control Three sets of 2.54mm (0.1") TCJ8 headers allow you to put up to three…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-joystick-2-channel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2053/images/11253/3109-0008-0001__58763.1705525465.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Speed Tuner', '3109-0009-0001', 'Control Your Servo''s Speed! Just plug the Servo Speed Tuner between your servo and your receiver, then adjust the dials! How It Works The Servo Speed Tuner has three different dials. Two of these dials, one(9) for clockwise (CW) and the other for counterclockwise (CCW) movement, allow you to adjust the CW speed independent of the CCW speed. The center dial allows you to adjust how quickly the servo ramps up to the desired speed (or ramps down to a stop) as it nears the target position.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-speed-tuner/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2224/images/13129/3109-0009-0001-Servo-Speed-Tuner__77486__66620.1722009110.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('12V Battery Health Analyzer (NiMH, 3000mAh)', '3109-0010-0001', 'While they don''t often show it on the outside, batteries are just as susceptible to wear over time as any other part of your robot. The Battery Health Analyzer tells you your battery''s internal resistance (IR) and voltage so that you can make better-informed decisions about your battery implementation! It''s specifically designed to measure the IR of a 12V, 3,000mAH NiMH battery like the Nested Battery. The Battery Health Analyzer is best used as a tool to compare multiple batteries. We…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/12v-battery-health-analyzer-nimh-3000mah/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2282/images/13603/Ang1__71893__15605.1729336773.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Batteries / Battery Testers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Swingarm Odometry Pod (48mm Wheel)', '3110-0001-0001', 'Help your robot find its way with the Swingarm Odometry Pod! It''s a precisely-designed sensor that ups the accuracy of localization when your robot operates autonomously. Designed from the heft of FTC experience in the goBILDA® R&D team, this Odometry Pod innovates to a higher level than comparable alternatives. The Swingarm Odometry Pod: Uses clever internal packaging in place of the gears often seen in odometry systems and encoders, resulting in smoother rotation and eliminating the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/swingarm-odometry-pod-48mm-wheel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2002/images/13261/3110-0001-0001-Odometry-Pod-FTC-Legal-Lower-Right-Corner__44011.1725054039.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Odometry', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Bar Odometry Pod (32mm Wheel)', '3110-0001-0002', 'Help your robot find its way with the goBILDA® 4-Bar Odometry Pod! It''s a precisely-designed sensor that ups the accuracy of localization when your robot operates autonomously. This 4-Bar Odometry Pod provides maximum mechanical ingenuity while saving you real estate in your robot. Designed from the heft of FTC experience in the goBILDA® R&D team, this Odometry Pod innovates to a higher level than comparable alternatives. The 4-Bar Odometry Pod: Uses clever internal packaging in place of the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-bar-odometry-pod-32mm-wheel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2232/images/16113/3110-0001-0002-Main__48535.1771444986.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Odometry', 'gobilda'),
  ('Pinpoint Odometry Computer (IMU Sensor Fusion for 2 Wheel Odometry)', '3110-0002-0001', 'Help your robot know exactly where it''s at with the Pinpoint Odometry Computer! This coprocessor performs sensor fusion between two Dead-Wheel Odometry Pods (like SKU: 3110-0001-0001 or 3110-0001-0002) and an internal IMU to locate your robot to a precise pinpoint. It reads your robot''s estimated position back to the controller via I²C, giving you access to data in a snap. Designed specifically for odometry in FTC, the Pinpoint hits two vital targets: 1. Ease of Use The Pinpoint makes…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/pinpoint-odometry-computer-imu-sensor-fusion-for-2-wheel-odometry/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2262/images/13386/unnamed__75902__17614.1726607396.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Pinpoint V2 Odometry Computer (IMU Sensor Fusion for 2 Wheel Odometry)', '3110-0002-0002', 'Help your robot know exactly where it''s at with the Pinpoint Odometry Computer! This coprocessor performs sensor fusion between two Dead-Wheel Odometry Pods (like SKU: 3110-0001-0001 or 3110-0001-0002) and an internal IMU to locate your robot to a precise pinpoint. It reads your robot''s estimated position back to the controller via I²C, giving you access to data in a snap. Designed specifically for odometry in FTC, the Pinpoint hits two vital targets: 1. Ease of Use The Pinpoint makes…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/pinpoint-v2-odometry-computer-imu-sensor-fusion-for-2-wheel-odometry/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2421/images/15232/Ang1__37180__82014.1758568445.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Odometry', 'gobilda'),
  ('Element Receiver', '3112-0006-0001', 'The Element Receiver is designed for use in the Element-4 (Pistol Grip) and Element-6 (Gimbals) Radio Control Systems. It is compact and has an internal antenna to keep your project clean. Use it to control servos, motor controllers, or send signals to an Arduino. Thanks to thru-holes on the goBILDA® 32mm square pattern, you can mount the Receiver directly to goBILDA® structure via M4 screws and locknuts. The square pattern allows the Receiver to be stacked on top of certain other…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/element-receiver/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1324/images/6527/3112-0006-0001__35212__59673.1701992880.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Transmitters & Receivers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Element-4 Radio Control System (Pistol Grip)', '3113-0004-0001', 'With an ergonomic design and built-in channel mixing, the Pistol Grip goBILDA® Element-4 Radio Control System allows you to control your project wirelessly across 4 channels of operation! Steering-Optimized Form Factor The transmitter''s handy pistol grip design brings comfort to control. You can even operate your applications with only one(10) hand! Four Channels, Infinite Options The first four numbered channels of the receiver are tied to specific control devices in the transmitter. Channels 1…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/element-4-radio-control-system-pistol-grip/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2004/images/10969/Ang5WReceiver__16369__29966.1701994269.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Transmitters & Receivers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Element-6 Radio Control System (Mode 2)', '3113-2006-0001', 'The Element 6 Radio Control System has 6 channels to control your project from afar. Channels 1-4 provide proportional control from the gimbals (joysticks). Built-in channel mixing and reversing allows you to easily configure this radio system to control a robot chassis to your liking. The fifth channel is a switch to send three pre-established signals which can be used to control lights, switches, relays or a servo that you want to send to three specific positions. Channel 6 is a proportional…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/element-6-radio-control-system-mode-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1326/images/11830/3113-2006-0001_Ang2__87845.1714773188.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Transmitters & Receivers', 'gobilda'),
  ('Signal-Boosting Servo Extension (3-Pos TJC8, MH-FC to FH-MC, 300mm Length)', '3116-1718-0300', 'Sometimes servo control signals can weaken over a long distance of wire or by being shared by multiple servos. A weak signal causes servos to jitter. The Signal-Boosting Servo Extension restores the signal by boosting the signal amplitude back up to the voltage sent from your battery or power supply. Simply plug-in the Signal-Boosting Servo Extension near your servo, and say farewell to jitters! Tech Tip Both our Boosted Servo-Extension and 4 Channel Servo Extension via CAT6 offer a way to…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/signal-boosting-servo-extension-3-pos-tjc8-mh-fc-to-fh-mc-300mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1888/images/14935/3116-1718-0300__03382.1750083996.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension via CAT6 (Sending Board)', '3116-2745-0001', 'This board takes a servo signal from an RC receiver or other source and sends it through a CAT6 cable via an RJ45 port. This Sending Board is the counterpart to the Receiving Board (3116-4527-0001). The two can be purchased together as 3802-2745-4527. Compatibility Ethernet Cables: While CAT6 is the recommended cable, the RJ45 connector this Servo Extension uses is also compatible with CAT5, CAT5e, CAT6a, and CAT8 cables. RC Receivers: This Boosted Servo Extension is compatible with any…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-via-cat6-sending-board/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1678/images/8762/3116-2745-0001-Ang3__20009__74333.1701993571.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Extension via CAT6 (Receiving Board)', '3116-4527-0001', 'This board takes a servo signal sent over a CAT6 cable and breaks it out through servo-compatible TJC8 pins. This Receiving Board is the counterpart to the Sending Board (3116-2745-0001). The two can be purchased together as 3802-2745-4527. Compatibility Ethernet Cables: While CAT6 is the recommended cable, the RJ45 connector this Servo Extension uses is also compatible with CAT5, CAT5e, CAT6a, and CAT8 cables. Servos: This Boosted Servo Extension is compatible with any servo which uses a PWM…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-extension-via-cat6-receiving-board/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1673/images/8739/3116-4527-0001-Ang3__15251__49798.1701993565.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3117 Series Enclosure (32-3)', '3117-0032-0003', 'This enclosure is used with various electronic boards from goBILDA. It is used to mount the boards to U-Channel and other components while also providing some mechanical and electrical protection. It includes two screws and two nuts to fasten the enclosure to the board. The remaining two holes (on the 32mm pattern) can be used to mount to your project''s structure.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3117-series-enclosure-32-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1677/images/8751/3117-0032-0003__02500__08931.1701993568.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('LED Light Panel (XT30 Input)', '3118-0102-0001', 'Light your way to brighter builds with the goBILDA® LED Light Panel! This brilliant block emits an extreme flood beam that illuminates everything it faces. With a compact design including XT30 input-output and mounting holes on the 32mm square pattern, it can attach to almost any goBILDA ® structure to daisy-chain with other lights or send power from a 10-30VDC power source to other electrical components.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/led-light-panel-xt30-input/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1753/images/9268/3118-0102-0001__48177__14923.1701993733.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('LED Headlight (400 Lumens, 5-30V Input)', '3118-0102-0002', 'Light your way to brighter builds with this LED Headlight! This brilliant block emits an extreme flood beam that illuminates everything it faces. With a compact design including XT30 input-output and mounting holes on the 32mm square pattern, it can attach to almost any goBILDA ® structure to daisy-chain with other lights or send power from a 5-30VDC power source to other electrical components. The convenient hex counterbores can capture 7mm hex-profile hardware (like M4 locknuts) to provide…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/led-headlight-400-lumens-5-30v-input/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2381/images/14695/3118-0102-0002_Ang1__21470__83392.1744657136.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('LED Headlight (400 Lumens, Dimmable, PWM Controlled)', '3118-0808-0001', 'Add exactly the lighting you need to your project with a brilliant LED Headlight you can operate with your favorite servo controller! This dimmable light has a maximum luminosity of 400 lumens and boasts a wide range of implementation options. Intelligent Illumination Controlling this LED Headlight is as easy as controlling a servo! Just plug it into a servo port, and you''ll get fine-grained PWM control of the LED brightness, from full "off" to full "on." This allows you to dial-in the light…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/led-headlight-400-lumens-dimmable-pwm-controlled/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2336/images/14262/Ang1__08942__34515.1733265827.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('RGB Indicator Light (PWM Controlled)', '3118-0808-0002', 'The goBILDA® RGB Indicator Light provides colorful lighting options across a spectrum of illumination. Its translation of standard servo PWM signals into specific colors and flash sequences makes it a PWM-reading crystal ball you can use to display the status of your robot! PWM-Controlled Color Light The colors and flash sequence of the Indicator Light are signal-dependent. (Check out Product Insight #4 to see how PWM ranges relate to the Indicator''s gradient of possible colors.) This allows…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/rgb-indicator-light-pwm-controlled/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2275/images/15135/RGBAnimationREV1__47808.1755705659.386.513.gif?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('LED Headlight for FTC (275 Lumens, Dimmable, PWM Controlled)', '3118-0808-0003', 'Light your robot''s way across the game field with the LED Headlight for FTC! Designed with the FIRST Tech Challenge in mind, this dimmable LED Headlight helps to illuminate the scenes that a robot''s optics systems gathers visual data from—whether that optics system is a basic webcam, or high-end AI camera (like the HuskyLens). Intelligent Illumination Controlling this LED Headlight is as easy as controlling a servo! Just plug it into a servo port, and you''ll get fine-grained PWM control of the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/led-headlight-for-ftc-275-lumens-dimmable-pwm-controlled/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2274/images/15137/3118-0808-0003-REV1-Ang1__76697.1755706187.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('Prism RGB LED Driver (6-30V Input, I²C / PWM Control)', '3118-2855-0001', 'Make creating eye-catching LED animations more performant than ever! The Prism LED Driver combines a PWM interface, an I²C interface, a voltage regulator, and 12 fully customizable animations packed with creative options in one(11) enclosure. Designed for Ease of Use The Prism LED Driver features a standard hobby servo PWM interface that allows you to capture the magic of RGB LEDs, with no code required! We leverage the customization available in each of the default animations to create 48…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/prism-rgb-led-driver-6-30v-input-i2c-pwm-control/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2461/images/15578/Ang1__49539__29435.1764171264.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('Prism RGB LED Strip (104mm Length, 6 LEDs) - 2 Pack', '3118-5555-0001', 'Light up your robot or project with this 104mm Length RGB LED Strip! It features 6 LEDs you can command using the goBILDA® Prism RGB LED Driver to create customizable color sequences and animations. You can daisy-chain it with other Prism RGB LED Strips via its 3-Pos JST PH connectors and included 300mm length wire to create exactly the illumination your project needs. Participating in the FIRST® Tech Challenge? You''ll be happy to know that Prism RGB LED Strips take the rigors of the FTC game…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/prism-rgb-led-strip-104mm-length-6-leds-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2463/images/15600/3118-5555-0001-animation__16806__57074.1764171298.386.513.gif?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('Prism RGB LED Strip (200mm Length, 12 LEDs) - 2 Pack', '3118-5555-0002', 'Light up your robot or project with this 200mm Length RGB LED Strip! It features 12 LEDs you can command using the goBILDA® Prism RGB LED Driver to create customizable color sequences and animations. You can daisy-chain it with other Prism RGB LED Strips via its 3-Pos JST PH connectors and included 300mm length wire to create exactly the illumination your project needs. Participating in the FIRST® Tech Challenge? You''ll be happy to know that Prism RGB LED Strips take the rigors of the FTC game…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/prism-rgb-led-strip-200mm-length-12-leds-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2462/images/15589/3118-5555-0002-animation__77722__25076.1764171284.386.513.gif?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Lights', 'gobilda'),
  ('4A BEC / Voltage Regulator (6-18V Input, Adjustable 5, 6, 8.4, 12V Output, XT30 Connectors)', '3119-2829-0004', 'This 4A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(12) of four selectable output voltages. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern! Two holes are pre-equipped with case-fastening screws that you can easily replace so you can use four screws in the installation of the BEC to your build. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery Eliminator Circuit (BEC) for how it eliminates the need…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4a-bec-voltage-regulator-6-24v-input-adjustable-5-6-8.4-12v-output-xt30-connectors/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1776/images/9418/3119-2829-0004__24167__28442.1701993778.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('6A BEC / Voltage Regulator (6-24V Input, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, XT30 Connectors) [V1]', '3119-2829-0006', 'This 6A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(13) of four selectable output voltages. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern! Two holes are pre-equipped with case-fastening screws that you can easily replace so you can use four screws in the installation of the BEC to your build. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery Eliminator Circuit (BEC) for how it eliminates the need…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6a-bec-voltage-regulator-6-18v-input-adjustable-5-6-8-4-12v-output-xt30-connectors-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1867/images/10062/3119-2829-0006__41811__38195.1701993984.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('30A BEC / Voltage Regulator (5-30V Input, 3.3V, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, XT30 Connectors)', '3119-2829-0030', 'This 30A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(14) of five selectable output voltages. It features reverse voltage protection and integrates a constant-voltage, constant-current step down controller, allowing the output voltage to fall if the current pulled from the device is above the maximum. This protection feature creates a seamless experience in over-current events. A dynamic temperature limit reduces the constant current target for the regulator as the temperature changes…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/30a-bec-voltage-regulator-5-30v-input-3-3v-5v-6v-8-4v-12v-output-xt30-connectors/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2520/images/16766/i%25252F118%25252FAng1__95492__43150.1782244916.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Voltage Regulators (BECs)', 'gobilda'),
  ('6A BEC / Voltage Regulator (6-24V Input, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, XT30 Connectors) [V2]', '3119-2829-0106', 'This 6A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(15) of four selectable output voltages. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to the four hex-counterbored thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern that provide for easy one(16)-tool installation. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery Eliminator Circuit (BEC) for how it eliminates the need for additional batteries when a project''s components require different voltages. To…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6a-bec-voltage-regulator-6-24v-input-5v-6v-8-4v-12v-output-xt30-connectors-v2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2400/images/15483/Ang1__79595.1763073603.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('6A BEC / Voltage Regulator (5-30V Input, 3.3V, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, XT30 Connectors)', '3119-2829-0206', 'This 6A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(17) of five selectable output voltages. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to the four hex-counterbored thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern that provide for easy one(18)-tool installation. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery Eliminator Circuit (BEC) for how it eliminates the need for additional batteries when a project''s components require different voltages. To…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6a-bec-voltage-regulator-5-30v-input-3-3v-5v-6v-8-4v-12v-output-xt30-connectors/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2466/images/15720/Ang1__67909.1767709902.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Voltage Regulators (BECs)', 'gobilda'),
  ('4A BEC / Voltage Regulator (6-18V Input, Adjustable 5, 6, 8.4, 12V Output, Screw Terminals)', '3119-4444-0004', 'This 4A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(19) of four selectable output voltages. Its screw terminals accept 14-26AWG stranded wires. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern. Two holes are pre-equipped with case-fastening screws that you can easily replace so you can use four screws in the installation of the BEC to your build. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4a-bec-voltage-regulator-6-18v-input-adjustable-5-6-8-4-12v-output-screw-terminals/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1791/images/9551/3119-4444-0004__40119__43748.1701993823.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('6A BEC / Voltage Regulator (6-24V Input, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, Screw Terminals) [V1]', '3119-4444-0006', 'This 6A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(20) of four selectable output voltages. Its screw terminals accept 14-26AWG stranded wires. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern. Two holes are pre-equipped with case-fastening screws that you can easily replace so you can use four screws in the installation of the BEC to your build. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6a-bec-voltage-regulator-6-24v-input-5v-6v-8-4v-12v-output-screw-terminals-v1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1865/images/10048/3119-4444-0006__25487__00506.1701993980.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('6A BEC / Voltage Regulator (5-30V Input, 3.3V, 5V, 6V, 8.4V, 12V Output, Screw Terminals)', '3119-4444-0206', 'This 6A BEC / Voltage Regulator reduces input voltage down to one(21) of four selectable output voltages. Its screw terminals accept 14-26AWG stranded wires. The BEC is highly mountable within the goBILDA® ecosystem thanks to the four hex-counterbored thru-holes on the 32mm square pattern that provide for easy one(22)-tool installation. Tech Terms In the world of R/C hobbyists, this component is known as a Battery Eliminator Circuit (BEC) for how it eliminates the need for additional batteries when a…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6a-bec-voltage-regulator-5-30v-input-3-3v-5v-6v-8-4v-12v-output-screw-terminals/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2448/images/15473/Ang1__54485.1763072667.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Voltage Regulators (BECs)', 'gobilda'),
  ('20A ATM Series Mini Blade Fuse - 4 Pack', '3121-0001-0020', 'This ATM Series Mini Blade Fuse is the same fuse that comes pre-installed in the 3100-0006-0003 and 3100-0012-0020. Extra fuses are fantastic to have on-hand in case you need to replace a blown fuse.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/20a-atm-series-mini-blade-fuse-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2342/images/14318/Ang2__39353__15390.1736522184.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Fuses', 'gobilda'),
  ('HuskyLens AI Camera Vision Sensor with goBILDA® Case', '3122-0001-0001', 'The HuskyLens Camera is an AI-powered vision sensor designed to make implementing computer vision in your robot a walk in the park. It offers baked-in tag detection alongside color and line recognition capabilities. This HuskyLens also features a goBILDA® case for easy solid attachment. Capabilities Quick List AprilTag detection and tracking Object detection and tracking Line tracking/following Color recognition Smart Object Detection Unlike other computer vision cameras that output raw camera…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/huskylens-ai-camera-vision-sensor-with-gobilda-case/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2268/images/13406/Ang1__35355__49973.1727447978.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Cameras', 'gobilda'),
  ('goBILDA® Case for HuskyLens AI Camera Vision Sensor', '3122-0001-0002', 'This goBILDA® Case for HuskyLens AI Camera Vision Sensor allows you to implement an existing HuskyLens camera into your robot via thru-holes on the goBILDA® pattern. Besides a pair of each M4 screws and locknuts for attaching the camera and case to your robot, this product also includes a JST PH cable you can use to connect your camera to your control hub.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-case-for-huskylens-ai-camera-vision-sensor/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2299/images/13683/Ang1__87037__78778.1730389618.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Limelight 3A Smart Camera', '3122-0002-0001', 'The Limelight 3A Smart Camera is a plug-and-play, zero-code perception system for FIRST Tech Challenge (FTC) teams. Based on the battle-tested Limelight 3 for FRC, it brings high performance AprilTag tracking, game piece tracking, and full-field robot localization to teams of all experience levels. The Limelight 3A Smart Camera comes with four 6mm length M4 socket head screws and a USB-C to USB-A cable. Hardware Features: All-Aluminum Enclosure Anti-Reflective Gorilla Glass Lens Cover REV and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/limelight-3a-smart-camera/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2237/images/13407/Ang1__01989.1727449275.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Cameras', 'gobilda'),
  ('Rolling Shutter USB Camera with goBILDA® Case (30 FPS)', '3122-0003-0001', 'Help your bot get a clear view of its position on the field with a webcam that''ll be right where you need it every time! This full-color USB Camera comes in a goBILDA®-designed case for versatile attachment to your robot. In order to facilitate plug-and-play action in FTC, it comes with a calibration file that helps it talk to your REV Control Hub from the get-go with optimized optics for tracking objects and localizing your robot. (Check out the User Guide below to help set it up with your…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/rolling-shutter-usb-camera-with-gobilda-case-30-fps/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2280/images/13580/Ang1__75219__33233.1728680752.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Cameras', 'gobilda'),
  ('Global Shutter USB Camera with goBILDA® Case (100 FPS)', '3122-0004-0001', 'Freeze-frame precision meets pattern-mounting convenience. Featuring a high-performance Arducam imaging module housed in a rugged goBILDA® case, this global shutter full-color USB camera brings rock-solid imaging performance to FTC teams during high-speed autonomous navigation. Unlike traditional rolling-shutter cameras that capture images row-by-row—causing geometric distortion and a "jello effect" when your robot turns—this camera utilizes a global shutter sensor to capture the entire frame…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/global-shutter-usb-camera-with-gobilda-case-100-fps/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2517/images/16724/s%25252F671%25252FAng1__36585__38235.1779487122.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Cameras', 'gobilda'),
  ('Laser Distance Sensor (1m Range, 3.3-5V, Digital or Analog Output)', '3124-0001-0001', 'The Laser Distance Sensor helps your robot to know the approximate distance between itself and an object. It operates by firing a laser, then measuring the time it takes for the laser light to be reflected off the object and back to the sensor. This allows it to sense the distance at ranges of up to 1 meter—depending on the reflectivity of the object''s surface. The Laser Distance Sensor can output an analog or a digital signal, according to the mode you select: Analog - Dynamic Range Mode When…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/laser-distance-sensor-1m-range-3-3-5v-digital-or-analog-output/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2451/images/15439/Ang1_3__12971__11318.1761761925.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Sensors', 'gobilda'),
  ('6V Servo Power Injector (6 Channel, 8-15V Input)', '3125-0001-0001', 'A power module crafted from years of voltage-regulating design experience, the 6V Servo Power Injector packages industry-leading power regulation into a truly tiny form factor! It''s designed to pull power from a 12V battery and regulate it down to 6V (at up to 24A) to power servos—particularly in applications utilized by teams participating in the FIRST Tech Challenge (FTC). The Servo Power Injector offers six TJC8 servo input and output connectors. Each input connector directly passes the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/6v-servo-power-injector-6-channel-8-15v-input/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2415/images/15105/3125-0001-0001-Ang1__73911__12352.1754504619.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Electronics', 'gobilda'),
  ('goRAIL® Bracket Assortment Pack (202 Pcs)', '3201-0003-0001', 'The goRAIL Bracket Assortment pack is a collection of the connecting pieces commonly used when building with goRAIL. Bundle Contents: SKU Qty Name 1137-0001-0001 2 1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (1-1) - 2 Pack 1137-0001-0002 2 1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (1-2) - 2 Pack 1137-0002-0001 2 1137 Series Steel Flat Grid Bracket (2-1) - 2 Pack 1126-0001-0001 2 1126 Series Steel Flat Bracket (1-1)- 2 pack 1204-0001-0001 2 1204 Series Gusseted Angle Mount (1-1) - 2 Pack 1204-0001-0002 2…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gorail-bracket-assortment-pack-202-pcs/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/956/images/4866/3201-0003-0001-Updated__38698__42722.1701992338.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / goRAIL® Accessories', 'gobilda'),
  ('Heat Shrink Tubing (560pc Assortment Pack)', '3201-0005-0001', 'For those not afraid to modify! This assortment pack consists of 560 pieces of 38mm length heat-shrink in various diameters and colors stowed away in a plastic case to keep things organized. Assortment Pack Contents: Color ID Length Qty Black 2mm 38mm 50 4mm 38mm 30 6mm 38mm 30 8mm 38mm 30 Red 2mm 38mm 50 4mm 38mm 30 6mm 38mm 30 8mm 38mm 30 Yellow 2mm 38mm 50 4mm 38mm 30 6mm 38mm 30 8mm 38mm 30 White 2mm 38mm 50 4mm 38mm 30 6mm 38mm 30 8mm 38mm 30', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/heat-shrink-tubing-560pc-assortment-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1195/images/5980/3201-0005-0001__61227__43735.1701992710.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('M4 Hardware Starter Pack (2625 Pcs)', '3201-0010-0001', 'Don''t let a hardware shortage hang up your build! Whether you''re an FTC team looking to stock up on the most commonly used attachment hardware, or a tinkerer who''s grown tired of making multiple trips to their favorite depot''s M4 bins, this M4 Hardware Starter Pack is a fine way to save big on fasteners! Bundle Contents: SKU Qty Name 2800-0004-0005 1 M4 x 0.7mm Zinc-Plated Socket Head Screw (5mm Length) - 25 Pack 2800-0004-0006 1 M4 x 0.7mm Zinc-Plated Socket Head Screw (6mm Length) - 25 Pack…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/m4-hardware-starter-pack-2625-pcs/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2359/images/14376/Thumbnail__48288__04734.1738185926.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('5mm Pitch HTD Timing Belt & Pulley Starter Pack (8mm REX® Bore)', '3201-0012-0001', 'Pulleys are fantastic solutions for smooth, reliable power transfer in all kinds of applications. The large tooth profile of 5mm pitch HTD timing belts and pulleys is excellent when you''re working with the hefty power of high-torque motors—such is in the drive assemblies of large-scale chassis. This 5mm HTD Timing Belts & Pulleys Starter Pack includes several lengths of belts, a selection of timing belt pulleys, a helping of idler pulleys, and all the hardware you need to mount them to your…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5mm-pitch-htd-timing-belt-pulley-starter-pack-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2265/images/13394/3201-0012-0001-5mm-HTD-Timing-Belt-Starter-Kit__79760__74436.1726858929.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('2mm Pitch GT2 Timing Belt & Pulley Starter Pack (8mm REX® Bore)', '3201-0013-0001', 'Pulleys are fantastic solutions for reliable power transfer in all kinds of applications. The fine tooth profile of 2mm pitch GT2 timing belts and pulleys is perfect for facilitating smooth, precise motion in the precision applications that most need it—such as XY tables, linear slide mechanisms, and 3D printers. This 2mm Pitch GT2 Starter Pack offers all the components and hardware you need to get up-and running quickly with precision timing belt action: A selection of essential belt loop…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2mm-pitch-gt2-timing-belt-pulley-starter-pack-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2266/images/13410/3201-0013-0001-2mm-GT2-Timing-Belt-Starter-Pack__87872.1727813794.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Timing Belts & Pulleys', 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Standard Size, 24 Tooth Spline, Hub-Shaft)', '3202-0001-2401', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock ™ ! This 24 tooth version has a hub-shaft which contains both threaded holes and thru-holes in order to mount nearly any goBILDA part to the top with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-standard-size-24-tooth-spline-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/805/images/4512/3202-0001-2401-Patented__62316__13009.1701992218.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Standard Size, 24 Tooth Spline, 10mm OD Shaft)', '3202-0001-2402', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock ™ ! This 24 tooth version has a 10mm diameter shaft which allows you to install a 10mm clamping hub onto. This gives you the ability to quickly and easily adjust the position of components attached to the hub without requiring disassembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-standard-size-24-tooth-spline-10mm-od-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/809/images/4528/3202-0001-2402-Patented__11151__82528.1701992223.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Standard Size, 25 Tooth Spline, Hub-Shaft)', '3202-0001-2501', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock®! This 25 tooth version has a hub-shaft which contains both threaded holes and thru-holes in order to mount nearly any goBILDA® part to the top with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-standard-size-25-tooth-spline-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/807/images/4521/3202-0001-2501__48420__06218.1701992220.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Standard Size, 25 Tooth Spline, 10mm OD Shaft)', '3202-0001-2502', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock ® ! This 25 tooth version has a 10mm diameter shaft which allows you to install a 10mm clamping hub onto. This gives you the ability to quickly and easily adjust the position of components attached to the hub without requiring disassembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-standard-size-25-tooth-spline-10mm-od-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/811/images/4535/3202-0001-2502__47325__62530.1701992225.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Standard Size, 25 Tooth Spline, 8mm OD Shaft)', '3202-0001-2503', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock®! This version is designed for a standard size servo with an H25T output spline. It has an 8mm diameter round shaft onto which you can install an 8mm clamping hub. This allows you to quickly and easily adjust the position of components attached to the hub without requiring disassembly. The round shaft''s profile provides for the infinite indexability of motion components like hubs and couplers, while its length allows for more axial…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-standard-size-25-tooth-spline-8mm-od-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2166/images/15929/Ang1__54808.1769793251.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Large Size, 24 Tooth Spline, Hub-Shaft)', '3202-0002-2401', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock ® ! This 24 tooth version has a hub-shaft which contains both threaded holes and thru-holes in order to mount nearly any goBILDA part to the top with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-large-size-24-tooth-spline-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/803/images/4503/3202-0002-2401-Patented__63435__36268.1701992216.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Large Size, 25 Tooth Spline, Hub Shaft)', '3202-0002-2501', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock ™ ! This 25 tooth version has a hub-shaft which contains both threaded holes and thru-holes in order to mount nearly any goBILDA part to the top with ease.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-large-size-25-tooth-spline-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/804/images/14759/3202-0002-2501__27592__11155__95379__80240.1746040888.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('ServoBlock® (Large Size, 25 Tooth Spline, 10mm OD Shaft)', '3202-0002-2502', 'Isolate the radial load from your servo with a ServoBlock®! This 25 tooth version has a 10mm diameter shaft which allows you to install a 10mm clamping hub onto. This gives you the ability to quickly and easily adjust the position of components attached to the hub without requiring disassembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servoblock-large-size-25-tooth-spline-10mm-od-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/808/images/14758/3202-0002-2502__28886__82505__09268__25857.1746040878.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('Swingarm Odometry Pack (2 Pods, 1 Pinpoint Computer)', '3203-3110-0001', 'Help your robot find itself on the FTC field with this all-in-one(23) odometry package! It features two Swingarm Odometry Pods, a Pinpoint Odometry Computer, and all the hardware and cables you need to integrate them into your robot and connect them to your REV Control Hub. This Odometry Pack is a plug-and-play way to cover your odometry implementation from the get-go. This Swingarm Pack is perfect for robot chassis with larger wheels (such as that of a 140mm Mecanum Wheel Strafer™ Chassis) as it…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/swingarm-odometry-pack-2-pods-1-pinpoint-computer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2260/images/15233/Ang1__07985__87116.1758633812.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Odometry', 'gobilda'),
  ('4-Bar Odometry Pack (2 Pods, 1 Pinpoint Computer)', '3203-3110-0002', 'Help your robot find itself on the FTC field with this all-in-one(24) odometry package! It features two 4-Bar Odometry Pods, a Pinpoint Odometry Computer, and all the hardware and cables you need to integrate them into your robot and connect them to your REV Control Hub. This Odometry Pack is a plug-and-play way to cover your odometry implementation from the get-go. This Pack is perfect for robot chassis with wheels in the ballpark of 96mm to 104mm diameter. If you''re working with larger wheels…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/4-bar-odometry-pack-2-pods-1-pinpoint-computer/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2261/images/16731/Ang1__66649.1781621496.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Odometry', 'gobilda'),
  ('Worm Gear Set (24:1 Ratio, 6mm D-Bore Worm)', '3204-0001-0001', 'This worm gear set works with a 6mm D-shaft as the input to the worm and the brass worm gear is able to fasten to an output shaft using a clamping or set screw hub. The 24mm center distance between the worm and the mating worm gear makes 1120 Series U-Channel the ideal structure to house this gear set in.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/worm-gear-set-24-1-ratio-6mm-d-bore-worm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1036/images/5034/3204-0001-0001__27623__21557.1701992408.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Worm Gear Set (28:1 Ratio, 8mm REX® Bore Worm)', '3204-0001-0002', 'This 28:1 Ratio Worm Gear Set is an excellent way to slow things down and increase torque! Worm gear sets are also a popular choice for applications that are not able to be backdriven. While you can use this set outside of 1120 Series Channel, the sizes of gears are tailored for the 43mm of internal width. The "Worm" The worm is the stainless steel component that is intended to be driven by an 8mm REX® shaft. The 8mm REX® bore of the worm creates a positive drive so there''s no chance of…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/worm-gear-set-28-1-ratio-8mm-rex-bore-worm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1505/images/7689/Ang1__95122__25241.1701993237.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Worm Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Worm Gear Set (28:1 Ratio, 6mm D-Bore Worm)', '3204-0001-0003', 'This 28:1 Ratio Worm Gear Set is an excellent way to slow things down and increase torque! It''s also a great choice when you need a gear system that can''t be backdriven. While you can use this set on the outside of channel, its gears are specially designed for 1120 Series U-Channel ''s internal 43mm width. The "Worm" The stainless steel worm is engineered to be driven by a 6mm D-shaft. When you''re using it inside 1120 Series U-Channel, you can stack a radial bearing and thrust bearing on each…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/worm-gear-set-28-1-ratio-6mm-d-bore-worm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1824/images/9832/3204-0001-0003-Ang1__51366__42523.1701993914.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Worm Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2:1 Ratio Bevel Gear Set (6mm D-Bore Pinion Gear)', '3204-0002-0001', 'This bevel gear set includes a 14 tooth pinion gear intended to mount to a 6mm d-shaft, and a 28 tooth hub gear intended to mount to a 16mm pattern hub. The combination of a 14 and 28 tooth gear creates a 2:1 ratio, which is most commonly used as a gear reduction, meaning the small gear is driving the large gear, although they can also be used as a 2:1 overdrive if speed is more important than torque. The 28 tooth gear has clearance for a hub with an overall diameter of 32mm. Sonic Hubs…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2-1-ratio-bevel-gear-set-6mm-d-bore-pinion-gear/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1038/images/5075/3204-0002-0001__05908__82602.1701992422.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2:1 Ratio Bevel Gear Set (8mm REX® Bore Pinion Gear)', '3204-0002-0002', 'This bevel gear set includes a 14 tooth pinion gear intended to mount to an 8mm REX® shaft, and a 28 tooth hub gear intended to mount to a 16mm pattern hub. The combination of a 14 and 28 tooth gear creates a 2:1 ratio, which is most commonly used as a gear reduction, meaning the small gear is driving the large gear. Although they can also be used as a 2:1 overdrive if speed is more important than torque. The 28 tooth gear has clearance for a hub with an overall diameter of 32mm. Sonic Hubs…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2-1-ratio-bevel-gear-set-8mm-rex-bore-pinion-gear/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1365/images/6705/3204-0002-0002__78791__26213.1701992938.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (2:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0002', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 2:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision two-fold. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-2-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1131/images/5661/3206-0002-0002__20429__73237.1701992603.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (3:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0003', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 3:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision by 3X. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities given…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-3-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1132/images/5671/3206-0002-0003__49013__55533.1701992607.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (4:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0004', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 4:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision by 4X. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities given…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-4-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1134/images/5685/3206-0002-0004__68686__51666.1701992612.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (5:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0005', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 5:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision by 5X. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities given…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-5-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1136/images/5699/3206-0002-0005__64350__73734.1701992617.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (7:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0007', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 7:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision by 7X. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities given…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-7-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1138/images/5713/3206-0002-0007__45799__59431.1701992621.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3206 Series Servo Gearbox (9:1 Ratio, Hitec HS-788HB Servo)', '3206-0002-0009', 'This Servo Gearbox is driven by the Hitec HS-788HB Sail Winch Servo, capable of rotating nearly 8 turns in stock form. This gearbox introduces a 9:1 external gear ratio in order to lessen the range while increasing the torque and precision by 9X. Having the servo mounted in the gearbox also isolates the load to a huge 32mm output hollow tube that is supported in a pair of bearings to protect the servo from any radial or axial loads. The gearbox opens up a world of mounting possibilities given…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3206-series-servo-gearbox-9-1-ratio-hitec-hs-788hb-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1140/images/5726/3206-0002-0009__73153__27093.1701992625.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3606 Series Mecanum Wheel Set (Bearing Supported Rollers, 100mm Diameter)', '3213-3606-0001', 'The goBILDA mecanum wheels are packed full of conveniences you won''t find in other brands. Each wheel has rollers which are supported by ball-bearings so that they rotate with ease. The black anodized aluminum side plates sandwich a beefy plastic wheel-center. The wheel-center possesses the goBILDA 16mm bolt pattern and 14mm center hole. This makes it easy to mount to a hub, goTUBE or component of your choice. To provide mounting options, the wheel-centers are offset so you can flip the wheel…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3606-series-mecanum-wheel-set-bearing-supported-rollers-100mm-diameter/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1231/images/6127/3213-3606-0001__58734__42209.1701992757.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('96mm Mecanum Wheel Set (70A Durometer Bearing Supported Rollers)', '3213-3606-0002', 'These 96mm diameter goBILDA® mecanum wheels are an excellent option for building a nimble chassis for smooth surfaces. Mecanum wheels provide maneuverability like no other wheel design. When used in a set of four, they allow omnidirectional movement. They give your robot the ability to move right, left, forward, backward, or at an oblique angle, while retaining the ability to rotate around the center of the chassis like a skid-steer chassis with conventional wheels. These particular mecanums…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/96mm-mecanum-wheel-set-70a-durometer-bearing-supported-rollers/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1445/images/7197/3213-3606-0002__85766__98186.1701993092.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Mecanum Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('140mm Mecanum Wheel Set (70A Durometer Bearing Supported Rollers)', '3213-3606-0003', 'These 140mm diameter mecanum wheels enable a chassis to move in any direction at any orientation. A mecanum-equipped chassis is omnidirectional: it can move in any cardinal direction (including oblique angles), rotate around any point of the chassis, and even rotate while moving! In addition to that capability, goBILDA® mecanums rock a suite of special qualities: Grippy 70a durometer rollers Sturdy steel side plates Narrow 37mm width goBILDA® pattern at the wheel core provides compatibility…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/140mm-mecanum-wheel-set-70a-durometer-bearing-supported-rollers/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2005/images/10986/Main__27402__15208.1701994274.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Mecanum Wheels', 'gobilda'),
