  ('Compact ServoBlock® (43mm Width, For Standard Size H25T Spline Servo, Hub-Shaft)', '3217-0001-2501', 'This 25 tooth ServoBlock® isolates radial loads from your servo with a robust frame that''s highly compact, super mountable, and rocking an integrated bearing to support its hub-shaft. Threaded holes on its face and sides allow for a staggering array of mounting options. Meanwhile, its hub-shaft maintains the goBILDA® 16mm pattern of surrounding structure with thru-holes and threaded holes to provide for easy attachment of almost any goBILDA® component. And thanks to the 43mm width of this…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/compact-servoblock-43mm-width-for-standard-size-h25t-spline-servo-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1795/images/9598/3217-0001-2501-Ang1__67823__10476.1701993838.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('Compact ServoBlock® (27mm Width, For Standard Size H25T Spline Servo, Hub-Shaft)', '3217-2701-2501', 'This 25 tooth ServoBlock® isolates radial loads from your servo with a robust frame that''s highly compact, super mountable, and rocking an integrated bearing to support its Hub-Shaft. Compared to the 43mm Width Compact ServoBlock (SKU: 3217-0001-2501), this ServoBlock™ is even more abbreviated in its design, boasting a 27mm width that helps it fit just right in 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel. The threaded holes on the face and sides provide for secure attachment via M4 screws. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/compact-servoblock-27mm-width-for-standard-size-h25t-spline-servo-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2023/images/11084/3217-2701-2501-Ang1__93211__73116.1701994311.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('Compact ServoBlock® (27mm Width, For Axon MINI Servo, Hub-Shaft)', '3217-2703-2501', 'Like all ServoBlocks®, the 3217-2703-2501 isolates radial loads from your servo using a robust, super-mountable frame and an integrated bearing to support its Hub-Shaft. What sets this model apart is its custom interior: it is tailor-made specifically for the unique footprint of the Axon MINI Servo. Sharing the same space-saving width as our 27mm wide Compact ServoBlock®, it is abbreviated enough to fit perfectly inside 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel. The M4 threaded holes on the side and…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/compact-servoblock-27mm-width-for-axon-mini-servo-hub-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2551/images/16980/Ang1__46053.1787946879.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / ServoBlocks®', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Clamping Sprocket (8mm REX® Bore, 14 Tooth)', '3302-4008-0014', 'This 14 tooth sprocket is designed to clamp onto an 8mm REX® shaft and integrate with 8mm pitch (05B) chain. Its two-piece clamping mechanism is a robust, non-marring solution for fastening to a shaft. Beyond its clamping function''s excellent performance in high-torque applications, the overall sprocket is also balanced for rapid rotation in high-speed applications. The steel construction provides excellent strength and wear resistance, making it suitable for heavy-duty applications. A single…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-clamping-sprocket-8mm-rex-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2378/images/14670/3302-4008-0014_Back__94567__75244.1743623802.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Clamping Sprocket (12mm REX® Bore, 14 Tooth)', '3302-4012-0014', 'Bring positive drive to your chain project with 12mm REX®! This steel 14 tooth sprocket is designed to clamp onto a 12mm REX® shaft and drive 8mm pitch (05B) chain. Its two-piece clamping mechanism is a robust, non-marring solution for fastening to a shaft. Beyond its clamping function''s excellent performance in high-torque applications, the sprocket is also balanced for use in high-speed situations. The steel construction provides excellent strength and wear resistance, making it suitable for…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-clamping-sprocket-12mm-rex-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2070/images/11349/3302-4012-0014_Back__97977__94068.1709571797.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('3306 Series 8mm Pitch Set Screw Sprocket (6mm D-Bore, 8 Tooth)', '3306-1006-0008', 'This product has been replaced by 3307-1006-0010. The 8 Tooth set screw sprocket is intended to be mounted to a 6mm D-shaft coming from a motor or within the drivetrain of your project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3306-series-8mm-pitch-set-screw-sprocket-6mm-d-bore-8-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/537/images/3409/3306-1006-0008__43277__76687.1701991889.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('3307 Series 8mm Pitch Steel Set-Screw Sprocket (6mm D-Bore, 10 Tooth)', '3307-1006-0010', 'This 10 Tooth sprocket has a 6mm D-bore to perfectly match our 6mm D-shafting, as well as the D-shafts used on our 5202 Series Gear Motors. The steel construction provides excellent strength and wear resistance. The built-in shim allows you to put this sprocket right up against a bearing without contacting the bearing''s outer race.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3307-series-8mm-pitch-steel-set-screw-sprocket-6mm-d-bore-10-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1370/images/6717/Ang1__21719__30872.1744920242.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('3307 Series 8mm Pitch Steel Set-Screw Sprocket (8mm REX® Bore, 10 Tooth)', '3307-4008-0010', 'This 8mm (05B) Pitch, 10 Tooth Sprocket has an 8mm REX® bore to perfectly match the tried-and-true 8mm REX® shafting you can find throughout the goBILDA® build system. The set-screws provide for a secure connection to the shaft. This sprocket''s steel construction provides excellent strength and wear resistance, and the built-in shim allows you to run it right up against a bearing without contacting the inner race. SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING NYLON PATCH The set-screw included with this…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3307-series-8mm-pitch-steel-set-screw-sprocket-8mm-rex-bore-10-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1372/images/11501/3307-4008-0010-REV1__06906.1711996545.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('3307 Series 8mm Pitch Steel Set-Screw Sprocket (8mm REX® Bore, 14 Tooth)', '3307-4008-0014', 'The 8mm REX® bore of this 14 Tooth sprocket enables awesome positive drive on 8mm REX® shafting–such as that of our 5203 or 5204 Series Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motors. Importantly, its 8mm long protrusion matches the thickness of standard Sonic Hubs. This makes exact alignment a breeze when it''s paired with a larger sprocket mounted to a Sonic Hub! Its steel construction also excellently resists wear, tear, and corrosion.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3307-series-8mm-pitch-steel-set-screw-sprocket-8mm-rex-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1792/images/9560/3307-4008-0014_Back_Angled__22534__28154.1701993827.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Chain Connecting Link - 6 Pack', '3308-0008-0001', 'Connecting links, also known as master links, allow you to link two ends of metal chain together.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-chain-connecting-link-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/541/images/3415/3308-0008-0001__89447__63051.1701991891.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Chain Add-&-Connect Link - 6 Pack', '3308-0008-0002', 'In some applications the correct chain length cannot be achieved with metal chain and standard connecting links. This Add-&-Connect link provides a chain length not otherwise able to be achieved.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-chain-add-connect-link-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/542/images/3418/3308-0008-0002__83637__80951.1701991893.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('Grid-Link for 8mm Pitch Steel Chain - 6 Pack', '3308-0008-0003', 'The Grid-Link is the "missing link" that opens up a world of linear motion possibilities. By replacing a standard outer link on your 8mm Pitch (05B) Steel Chain, you gain two mounting holes that travel wherever your chain goes. The mounting holes are spaced 16mm apart, aligning perfectly with the goBILDA® 8mm grid. This makes it easy to fasten U-Channel, beams, or standoffs directly to the chain to create a conveyor, or elevator on your robot, and even work double-duty and serve as a trigger…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/grid-link-for-8mm-pitch-steel-chain-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2503/images/16475/3308-0008-0003-Wings-Up__62899.1775071231.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Chain (1 Meter Length)', '3308-0008-1000', 'Our 8mm pitch steel chain has an impressive 120kg working load. That''s more than triple what #25 (0.250") chain is able to handle! The 8mm pitch coincides with the 8mm grid of structural components in goBILDA®, which makes determining the proper chain length more simple. Because there are 5 connecting links for each meter of chain, you can create several drives with the pieces provided.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-chain-1-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/539/images/3413/3308-0008-1000__19200__71491.1701991890.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('3309 Series 8mm Pitch Plastic Chain (50 Links/400mm, Black)', '3309-0108-0050', 'Whether you''re a tinkerer who enjoys the build process as much as the finished product or you just want the freedom of changing the chain length at will, the plastic chain is an excellent alternative to metal chain. Don''t let the material fool you - this chain has an impressive 100lb working load capable of handling the torque transferred through most sprocket drive setups.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3309-series-8mm-pitch-plastic-chain-50-links-400mm-black/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/544/images/3429/3309-0108-0050__09320__99679.1713541925.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm Pitch Steel Hub-Mount Sprocket (14mm Bore, 14 Tooth)', '3310-0014-0014', 'The 14 tooth sprocket is the smallest tooth count that will fit on a 16mm pattern hub. The protrusion on each side provides room for the chain links to pass without contacting the hub it''s mated to. The threaded holes allow the sprocket to be fastened to thru-hole components while the thru-holes allow it to be fastened to threaded components.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-pitch-steel-hub-mount-sprocket-14mm-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/546/images/3441/3310-0014-0014_REV3__76025__13761.1701991900.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain', 'gobilda'),
  ('3310 Series 8mm Pitch Aluminum Hub Mount Sprocket (14mm Bore, 28 Tooth)', '3310-0014-0028', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/3310-series-8mm-pitch-aluminum-hub-mount-sprocket-14mm-bore-28-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/548/images/3444/3310-0014-0028__54761__82917.1701991901.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Sprockets & Chain / 14mm Bore Metal Hub-Mount Sprockets', 'gobilda'),
